sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as React browser
  participant API as Django
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker / recovery
  UI->>API: 1–2 POST /api/jobs/ + retry key
  API->>DB: Reserve / store / finalize admission
  API-->>UI: 202 queued + owned job ID
  Note over UI: 7.1 /jobs/id · navigation stays available
  Note over W: 3–5 dispatch + independent processing
  W->>DB: 6 One transaction: outcome + completion notice
  loop Visible / online, bounded nonoverlapping reads
    UI->>API: 7.2 GET notifications/ + jobs/status
    API->>DB: Owner-scoped persisted state
    DB-->>API: Status / optional result / inbox
    API-->>UI: JSON + unread count
  end
  alt Same processing route still active and success has a report
    UI->>UI: 7.3 Replace route with /results/id
  else User is elsewhere
    Note over UI: Keep current page and draft, show saved notice
    UI->>UI: Open saved notice: /results/id or /jobs/id
    opt Separate Mark as read action
      UI->>API: POST notification read acknowledgement
      API-->>UI: Read receipt, result access independent
    end
  end
  Note over UI,DB: Closed/offline browser catches up on return, in-app delivery
